WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.820
In 1968, Pope Paul VI published
a letter called Humanae Vitae.

2
00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:11.340
It taught Catholics that sex in marriage has
two meanings that must never be separated.

3
00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:16.110
Yet many other Christians see the pill
as a responsible way to plan a family.

4
00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:21.060
Both groups read the same Bible, and
both value family life and children.

5
00:00:21.110 --> 00:00:24.420
So why can one married couple use
the pill with a clear conscience,

6
00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:26.300
while another won't?

7
00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:29.840
In this mission, you'll find
out what those two meanings are,

8
00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:32.400
and what they rule in or out.

9
00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:35.850
Then you'll see where other churches
stand along a line of views,

10
00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:38.840
and where other faiths
draw their lines too.

11
00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:44.280
Your mission: explain why two faithful
married couples can reach opposite answers.
